= [242 + 2 (563)] \text{ kJ} - [2 \times 431 + 155] \text{ kJ}

= 1368 \text{ kJ} - 1017 \text{ kJ}

\Delta H^{0} = 351 \text{ kJ}
\Delta_{\perp}H^0 calculated by these two different methods are nearly the same.

