K_{\rm p} = \frac{{\rm p}_{\rm HI}^2}{{\rm p}_{\rm H_2} \cdot {\rm p}_{\rm I_2}}
K_{c} = \frac{(\text{mol } L^{-1})^{2}}{(\text{mol } L^{-1})(\text{mol } L^{-1})} K_{p} = \frac{\text{bar}^{2}}{(\text{bar})(\text{bar})}
\therefore Hence K_n and K_n have no units in such cases.
(b) The reaction where there is change in the moles of substance i.e. \Delta n \neq 0.

