Using the relation, v^2 - u^2 = 2as, we have
or v_2^2 - v_1^2 = -2g(2r) \qquad (s = 2r \text{ and } g \text{ is negative}) v_1^2 = v_2^2 + 4gr v_1^2 = gr + 4gr = 5gr or v_1 = \sqrt{5gr}
