Since \frac{1}{v_e} - \frac{1}{u_e} = \frac{1}{f_e} for the eyepiece, we can write
\frac{1}{u_e} = \frac{1}{v_e} - \frac{1}{f_e}
= -\frac{1}{f_e} \left( 1 - \frac{f_e}{v_e} \right)
